1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,119
Hello. My name is Iris.

2
00:00:02,939 --> 00:00:08,119
I'm here to welcome you to AEGIS and guide
you through the onboarding process, if

3
00:00:08,119 --> 00:00:08,699
you choose.

4
00:00:09,779 --> 00:00:12,420
Before we begin, one important point about
your data.

5
00:00:13,359 --> 00:00:16,159
Your information remains private and
belongs to you.

6
00:00:16,819 --> 00:00:20,420
It is not sold, shared, or distributed to
3rd parties.

7
00:00:21,459 --> 00:00:25,479
AEGIS uses your input only to create your
personal experience and generate your

8
00:00:25,479 --> 00:00:26,619
individual insights.

9
00:00:27,939 --> 00:00:29,619
We will begin with a short questionnaire.

10
00:00:30,239 --> 00:00:32,540
Take your time. There are no right
answers.

11
00:00:33,340 --> 00:00:35,619
When you are ready, select Start the Quiz.

12
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:37,939
I will be here when you are finished.
